{
 "url": "https://dy8q0bnq8y.feishu.cn/wiki/MxYVwN0lEiv5HUkLEJccRJI3nTd",
 "title": "如何想Idea？ - 飞书云文档",
 "blocks": {
  "2": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">想Idea主要分成两步：选择一个好的研究问题，寻求问题的解决方案。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "callout"
  },
  "3": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">想Idea主要分成两步：选择一个好的研究问题，寻求问题的解决方案。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "4": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">Problem-driven vs Method-driven </span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading1"
  },
  "5": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">一般的研究过程可以分为Problem-driven Research 和 Method-drvien Research</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "6": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">简单来说，</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "7": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">Problem-driven research</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：找到一个重要的问题或者目标，想办法把它做好，比如：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "8": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">大模型在某个任务上性能不好，如何把性能提上去？你可以先确定1-2个benchmark，再尝试探索各种相关的技术，目标就是把任务做work。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "9": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">也可以尝试去构建benchmark，把一个问题定义清楚，比如，游戏Agent方向，假设我们希望探究LLM在xx任务上的性能，但是现在还没有一个benchmark能支持类似的评估，你就可以去定义一个新的benchmark</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "10": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">或者在领域通用的benchmark上，对已有的技术方案进行问题分析，找到其中存在的关键挑战和问题，比如，GRPO的效率问题、信用分配问题等等，然后去尝试改进和优化。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "11": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">Method-driven research</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：拿着锤子找钉子，基于已有的技术方案，去不断解决新的问题。比如，GRPO刚出来的时候，拿来做多模态推理、Agentic RL；Skill火的时候，去解决各种数学、医疗、司法垂域问题；</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "12": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">当然，这两种方式很多时候都是要融合的，大部分情况下我们更偏好Problem或者说Goal-driven research，在这个过程中，去对method进行适配和优化。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "13": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如何找到研究问题？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading1"
  },
  "14": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">批判性论文阅读</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "15": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">参考</span><span class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\"><span data-rect-container=\"true\"><span data-zero-space=\"true\">​</span><span data-fake-text=\" \" contenteditable=\"false\" selectionapi=\"[object Object]\" class=\"mention-doc-embed-container\"><a class=\"mention-doc mention-doc-permission-fg contextmenu-without-copyperm\" target=\"_self\" href=\"https://dy8q0bnq8y.feishu.cn/wiki/Ow8fw2HtEiixDgkWlkbckdvHnef\" data-href=\"https://dy8q0bnq8y.feishu.cn/wiki/Ow8fw2HtEiixDgkWlkbckdvHnef\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-component-id=\"18bac62f-1ac0-4455-a42d-900f7a4448b9\" data-token=\"Ow8fw2HtEiixDgkWlkbckdvHnef\" data-icon-info=\"null\"><span class=\"embed-inline-link embed-inline-link--hoverable\"><span><span class=\"custom-icon gpf-biz-suite-custom-icon__icon-wrapper\"><span class=\"gpf-biz-suite-custom-icon__icon-emoji windows\">📑</span></span><span class=\"text embed-text-container\">如何读论文？</span></span></span></a></span></span></span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">中提到的，在阅读论文的过程中，要尝试去“鸡蛋里面挑骨头”，多去思考论文存在的不足和问题，从而提出新的问题。</span><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">把“读文献”和“提问题”绑在一起,而不是分成两个阶段，</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">要主动思考“如果这个论文换个数据/换个假设会怎样”。这个习惯越早养成越好，很多研究生前一两年读了大量文献却提不出问题，就是因为读的时候只在“理解”，没有在“批判性质疑”。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "16": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">从失败中寻找机会</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "17": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">要思考当前的主流方案有哪些failure case，主动寻找和复现failure case，深入分析为什么会出现failure case，探究其背后的原因，尝试提出解决方案</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "18": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">从“是否有效、为什么有效”，反推机制</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "19": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">对一个效果很好、但缺乏解释的方法主动追问“它内部到底在做什么、为什么能 work”，通过设计实验去进行算法分析，这类“reverse-engineering”式的问题往往比“设计一个新方法”更容易找到明确的切入口，因为你有一个已经确定有效的现象作为锚点，只需要设计实验或理论工具去拆解它，而不是从零猜一个新方法是否有效。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "20": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">代表性的案例：清华大学黄高老师团队的NeurIPS 2025 最佳论文提名：</span><span class=\"outer-u-container docx-outer-link-container\" data-inline-wrapper=\"true\"><span class=\" author-7076000738450669572 link-wrapper link-text-color link-start link-end link-id-20-0-1\" data-leaf=\"true\"><a style=\"cursor:pointer;text-decoration-skip:none;\" class=\"link contextmenu-without-copyperm\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.13837\" data-href=\"https%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fabs%2F2504.13837\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" data-link-node=\"true\"><span data-string=\"true\">Does Reinforcement Learning Really Incentivize Reasoning Capacity in LLMs Beyond the Base Model?</span></a></span></span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "21": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">矛盾与不一致驱动</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "22": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">留意文献里彼此矛盾的结论，两篇论文用相似的设定，却得出不一样甚至相反的结果。矛盾本身就是一个现成的研究问题：为什么 A 和 B 不一致？是数据、假设、评测方式,还是某个隐藏变量的差异导致的？这类问题的好处是研究问题已经被“半定义”好了，你要做的更多是设计对照实验去定位分歧的真正来源,而不是从头构造一个全新问题</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "23": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-blue-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-blue\" data-leaf=\"true\">从真实应用场景中倒推</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading2"
  },
  "24": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">从企业真实的需求和痛点出发，比如：</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "25": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如果有企业实习的机会，在实习期间要多去了解企业的真实难点，看看哪些可以抽象成Research Problem。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "26": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">查看企业发布的各种项目指南，比如，“中国计算机学会”发布的CCF-XX企业联合基金，“中国人工智能学会”发布的CAAI-XX企业联合基金等，华为的揭榜挂帅项目等，此类信息一般可以从公众号和相关网站上获取到，这种功能指南一般都是企业已经基于自己的业务问题抽象好的research problem。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "ordered"
  },
  "27": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "28": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如何判断一个问题值不值得做</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading1"
  },
  "29": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">通常情况下，需要和导师沟通讨论来判断该问题是不是值得做。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "30": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">等成为高年级博士生之后，就需要有独立的价值判断能力，一个很简单的标准：</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">这个问题是不是让你感到兴奋？是不是该方向的瓶颈问题？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "31": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "text"
  },
  "32": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">如何解决问题？</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "heading1"
  },
  "33": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">迁移型</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：从其他领域借鉴成熟的方法、技术或理论，以解决当前领域尚未被解决的问题，比如ViT将注意力机制从文本迁移到图像领域。这种情况需要广泛阅读文献，寻找问题内核相同的技术，从而实现解法的迁移。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "34": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">结合型</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：能不能把A和B拼接起来？这里指的不是简单的拼接，而是具有创新性的组合，比如DQN把深度学习和强化学习结合起来，可以解决传统强化学习难以感知图像画面的问题。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "35": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">开创型</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：改变游戏规则，比如AlphaFold，面对蛋白质结构这一世纪难题，没有沿用传统的物理建模思路，而是重构了问题，基于深度学习从蛋白质序列中预测结果，这个比较难，需要一些智慧与灵感。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "36": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572 textHighlight textHighlight-pink-text textHighlight-ccmtoken-doc-textcolor-red\" data-leaf=\"true\">AI辅助</span><span data-string=\"true\" class=\" author-7076000738450669572\" data-leaf=\"true\">：2026年，与AI的讨论可以帮助你提出不少解决问题的方法。</span><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
   "type": "bullet"
  },
  "37": {
   "payload": {
    "zoneHTML": "<div class=\"ace-line\" data-node=\"true\" dir=\"auto\"><span data-string=\"true\" data-enter=\"true\" data-leaf=\"true\">​</span></div>"
   },
